+symbol upper_first ≔ @homology_whole_window_first_pair C P t Ab Am Bm Dm A0 B0 D0 A1 B1 D1 A2 B2 D2 rowm row0 row1 row2 F G J z0 z1 C1 T T0 KP QP;
+symbol upper_first_exact ≔ @homology_whole_window_first_exact C P t Ab Am Bm Dm A0 B0 D0 A1 B1 D1 A2 B2 D2 rowm row0 row1 row2 F G J z0 z1 C1 T T0 KP QP;
